# Every image builds from the repository root. Keep the context small and keep
# local secrets out of image layers. The Dockerfiles only COPY packages/*,
# apps/agent and apps/web (package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml, drizzle/, public/,
# scripts/, sources), none of which are excluded here.

# VCS and editor/agent folders
.git
.github
.windsurf
.claude
.DS_Store

# Dependencies and build output (installed fresh inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.venv
venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/dist
**/build
coverage
**/coverage

# Local configuration and secrets
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/.data
*.pem

# Logs, docs and media
*.log
**/*.log
docs
media
recordings
**/*.mp4
**/*.webm
